 the Hour appears the criminals will be in despair.","j":21,"h":41,"s":30,"a":12,"sd":null},{"k":"30:13","t":"And there will not be for them among their [alleged] partners any intercessors, and they will [then] be disbelievers in their partners.","j":21,"h":41,"s":30,"a":13,"sd":null},{"k":"30:14","t":"And the Day the Hour appears - that Day they will become separated.","j":21,"h":41,"s":30,"a":14,"sd":null},{"k":"30:15","t":"And as for those who had believed and done righteous deeds, they will be in a garden [of Paradise], delighted.","j":21,"h":41,"s":30,"a":15,"sd":null}],"juz":21,"hizb":41,"surahs":[30],"sajdah":false}